 "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
 "title": "GET /api/data/project: the one projection service (owner: Claude A)",
 "description": "Flow: inputs -> learned models (ml_forecast, ml_part, ml_equip_risk, ml_leadtime) -> AI projection review (spi/ai/review.js, decides each part's demand basis and insurance spare, factor 0.5 to 2) -> engine (/api/data/golden) -> pages. Same query as /api/data/golden, plus adj (JSON {material_no: factor}, accepted Gemini factors from /api/ai/review). axis = history months then 12 projected months; series values are null where they do not apply. Client: spiProject(scope, inputs) in src/modules/spi_proj.js; spiProjBasis(payload) draws the basis strip.",
